kanso.nvim
----------

  https://github.com/webhooked/kanso.nvim

  Every colour value in these themes resolves to an entry in
  `lua/kanso/colors.lua` from kanso.nvim (the `inkBg*`, `zenBg*`, `mistBg*`,
  `pearl*`, `gray*`, `violet*`, `blue*`, `green*`, `orange*`, `red*`,
  `yellow*`, `aqua`, `diffGreen` and `diffRed` palette entries). Kanso is
  itself a port of Kanagawa.

